ious, and evil. If you get to know him as well as he'll get to know you, you might find a way out. Or maybe you'll prefer to stay? I'm not judging anyone here ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515380/extras/83d0061485206ca3f30568ccc6ffbd42.avif?t=1752606457\" width=800 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has been a personal challenge for me to improve my skills in all areas. There's new gameplay, new features, well over 500 images in brand new art, and for the first time ever, I've learned how to make my own music for the game. I hope you enjoy &lt;3</p>",
